        "item0": {
          "type": "guide",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/MAD09999_088a7299-8065-43c1-8a94-905237bda6b0.jpg",
            "show_legacy_media": false,
            "image_url": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0609/7797/1333/files/MAD09999_088a7299-8065-43c1-8a94-905237bda6b0.jpg?v=1792996184",
            "heading": "2026 Ultimate Guide to Choosing Best Invisible Undies for Office Pants",
            "category": "Fit Guide",
            "summary": "Choose smooth edges and a fit that stays comfortable through a full day at your desk.",
            "content": "<p>Start with the trousers you wear most. Fine or close-fitting fabrics can make raised seams and tight elastic more noticeable. Look for a smooth edge, then choose the amount of coverage you find comfortable.</p><p>Try a NuCloud Mid-Rise Brief for everyday coverage or a Hipster Bikini for a lower waist. Use the product size chart and check the fit while sitting and walking. A waistband should lie comfortably without digging in.</p>",
